+        <div id="coworkDialog" class="settingcard cowork-chat" hidden aria-label="Co-work chat"><h3>Co-work chat</h3><p>Keep chatting with your selected AI. Send follow-ups while your AI works. New requests join your active work at the next safe message boundary. The AI can move between independent tasks while preserving every unfinished goal.</p><textarea class="instructions-text" id="coworkPrompt" aria-label="Next request" placeholder="Add another request…"></textarea><div class="instructions-actions"><button class="accentbtn" id="queueCowork">Send</button><button class="accentbtn" id="resumeCowork">Resume queue</button></div><div class="instructions-status" id="coworkStatus" role="status" style="margin-top:10px"></div><div id="coworkList"></div></div>
